  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP/BHC - Scaling up Renewable Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling up renewable energy jobs in the Republic of Mauritius with emphasis on Women and Youth.	With a view to addressing the capacity gaps for women in the RE sector and encouraging the Youth to get engaged, and more precisely, in the solar photovoltaic (PV) field, the project aims to provide the necessary support and empower women and youth in the RE sector through funding RE initiatives at small enterprises/ NGOs/ CSOs.</narrative>
  </description>
